This licence covers the application code only. Three other things ship with it
and are not the author's to license:

  Scripture
    The World English Bible, in the public domain, in assets/bible.db. It may
    be copied, quoted and redistributed freely, including commercially. The one
    condition is a trademark one: text that has been altered must not still be
    called the World English Bible. Nothing here alters it.
    https://ebible.org/engwebp/copyright.htm

  Typefaces
    Merriweather, Inter and Playfair Display, in assets/fonts/, each under the
    SIL Open Font License 1.1. The licence text for each sits beside them and
    is shown in the app under More → Licenses. They are bundled unmodified, so
    the Reserved Font Names on Merriweather and Playfair Display are not
    engaged.

  Brand marks
    The social icons on the More tab come from Font Awesome Free (CC BY 4.0 /
    SIL OFL / MIT by file type). Each brand mark is a trademark of its owner
    and is used here only to link to the author's own account on that service.
    Their presence is not endorsement in either direction.
